    "b-step6-body-2": {
      "id": "b-step6-body-2",
      "flavour": "paragraph",
      "children": [],
      "props": {},
      "text": [
        {
          "insert": "With the board’s sections established, the agent finishes Score gate content before wiring it. The first call adjusts "
        },
        {
          "insert": "score",
          "attributes": {
            "code": true
          }
        },
        {
          "insert": " content by tightening objdiff, qa, and regress and adding the absorb and reject pills. The outcomes copy one size and baseline below their centered parent; Score gate then auto-fits from the changed children. The agent judges that pushed render before the second call adds all ten connections, with every endpoint already present. The retry edge and saves-to-objdiff edge are direct connection declarations; the production router chooses their paths, and ROUTES reports the true polylines and crossed boxes. Each result returns APPLIED, a fresh BOARD digest, document-derived DELTA, cumulative BOARD DIFF, LINTS, REQUESTS, and a fresh full-board render. The connection call additionally returns ROUTES for all ten new edges. Because "
        },
        {
          "insert": "view",
          "attributes": {
            "code": true
          }
        },
        {
          "insert": " names score, the same response also pushes a score-section close-up."
        }
      ]
    },
    "b-step6-code-3": {
      "id": "b-step6-code-3",
      "flavour": "code",
      "children": [],
      "props": {
        "language": "json"
      },
      "text": [
        {
          "insert": "[\n  {\n    \"ops\": [\n      {\n        \"type\": \"updateObject\",\n        \"objectId\": \"objdiff\",\n        \"patch\": {\n          \"geometry\": { \"x\": 848, \"y\": 96, \"width\": 112, \"height\": 64 }\n        }\n      },\n      {\n        \"type\": \"updateObject\",\n        \"objectId\": \"qa\",\n        \"patch\": {\n          \"geometry\": { \"x\": 848, \"y\": 192, \"width\": 112, \"height\": 64 }\n        }\n      },\n      {\n        \"type\": \"updateObject\",\n        \"objectId\": \"regress\",\n        \"patch\": {\n          \"geometry\": { \"x\": 848, \"y\": 288, \"width\": 112, \"height\": 64 }\n        }\n      },\n      {\n        \"type\": \"addObject\",\n        \"object\": {\n          \"id\": \"absorb\",\n          \"type\": \"pill\",\n          \"text\": \"absorb\",\n          \"geometry\": { \"x\": 800, \"y\": 480, \"width\": 64, \"height\": 32 }\n        }\n      },\n      {\n        \"type\": \"addObject\",\n        \"object\": {\n          \"id\": \"reject\",\n          \"type\": \"pill\",\n          \"text\": \"reject\",\n          \"geometry\": { \"x\": 944, \"y\": 480, \"width\": 64, \"height\": 32 }\n        }\n      }\n    ],\n    \"view\": \"score\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"ops\": [\n      {\n        \"type\": \"addConnection\",\n        \"connection\": {\n          \"id\": \"conn-1-cli-sched\",\n          \"from\": { \"objectId\": \"cli\" },\n          \"to\": { \"objectId\": \"sched\" }\n        }\n      },\n      {\n        \"type\": \"addConnection\",\n        \"connection\": {\n          \"id\": \"conn-2-sched-workers\",\n          \"from\": { \"objectId\": \"sched\" },\n          \"to\": { \"objectId\": \"workers\" }\n        }\n      },\n      {\n        \"type\": \"addConnection\",\n        \"connection\": {\n          \"id\": \"conn-3-workers-match\",\n          \"from\": { \"objectId\": \"workers\" },\n          \"to\": { \"objectId\": \"match\" }\n        }\n      },\n      {\n        \"type\": \"addConnection\",\n        \"connection\": {\n          \"id\": \"conn-4-match-objdiff\",\n          \"from\": { \"objectId\": \"match\" },\n          \"to\": { \"objectId\": \"objdiff\" }\n        }\n      },\n      {\n        \"type\": \"addConnection\",\n        \"connection\": {\n          \"id\": \"conn-5-objdiff-qa\",\n          \"from\": { \"objectId\": \"objdiff\" },\n          \"to\": { \"objectId\": \"qa\" }\n        }\n      },\n      {\n        \"type\": \"addConnection\",\n        \"connection\": {\n          \"id\": \"conn-6-qa-regress\",\n          \"from\": { \"objectId\": \"qa\" },\n          \"to\": { \"objectId\": \"regress\" }\n        }\n      },\n      {\n        \"type\": \"addConnection\",\n        \"connection\": {\n          \"id\": \"conn-7-regress-absorb\",\n          \"from\": { \"objectId\": \"regress\" },\n          \"to\": { \"objectId\": \"absorb\" }\n        }\n      },\n      {\n        \"type\": \"addConnection\",\n        \"connection\": {\n          \"id\": \"conn-8-regress-reject\",\n          \"from\": { \"objectId\": \"regress\" },\n          \"to\": { \"objectId\": \"reject\" }\n        }\n      },\n      {\n        \"type\": \"addConnection\",\n        \"connection\": {\n          \"id\": \"conn-9-match-workers\",\n          \"from\": { \"objectId\": \"match\" },\n          \"to\": { \"objectId\": \"workers\" }\n        }\n      },\n      {\n        \"type\": \"addConnection\",\n        \"connection\": {\n          \"id\": \"conn-10-saves-objdiff\",\n          \"from\": { \"objectId\": \"saves\" },\n          \"to\": { \"objectId\": \"objdiff\" }\n        }\n      }\n    ],\n    \"view\": \"score\"\n  }\n]"
        }
